# MentorOS · Module Implementation Mandate

Before implementing or changing any research module / related API / skill injection:

1. Open `docs/distill/README.md`
2. Open the matching `docs/distill/modules/<module>.md`
3. Obey `docs/distill/shared/*` (evidence, gates, fatal flaws, five dimensions, HITL)
4. Align I/O with `docs/distill/schemas/handoff.ts`
5. Wire silent prompts from `docs/distill/injectable/*` plus existing skills under `src/backend/plugins/phd-research/skills/`
6. Use `docs/distill/sources/*` only for provenance / absorption boundaries — do not vendor entire upstream repos

## Non-negotiables

- Human-in-the-loop; no default unattended auto-publish
- Evidence discipline (no model-memory citations/numbers)
- Integrity gates BLOCK/WARN before submission readiness
- Silent skill injection (no skill marketplace UI)
- Locale en/zh for UI and generated narrative
- Module handoff via structured packets in `handoff.ts`

